    "detailed_description": "<h1>A rich village, social, and equipment trading system.</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich village, social, and equipment trading system.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/ab53355a7e0fc2ea6cd52f72a43029c8.poster.avif?t=1754816306\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/ab53355a7e0fc2ea6cd52f72a43029c8.webm?t=1754816306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/ab53355a7e0fc2ea6cd52f72a43029c8.mp4?t=1754816306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Thrilling PVE level challenges.</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling PVE level challenges.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/6bec66a331807ad05734383e3de8d894.poster.avif?t=1754816306\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/6bec66a331807ad05734383e3de8d894.webm?t=1754816306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/6bec66a331807ad05734383e3de8d894.mp4?t=1754816306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Skill-testing PVP player duels.</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-testing PVP player duels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/15dbd8785e23e3978f253c0bcf517f75.poster.avif?t=1754816306\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/15dbd8785e23e3978f253c0bcf517f75.webm?t=1754816306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/15dbd8785e23e3978f253c0bcf517f75.mp4?t=1754816306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the virtual world of <i>GigaSlave</i>, you will take on the role of an agent, tackling various plot-driven challenges and engaging in real combat against other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features and Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolling Horizontal Shooter Cooperative Mode: This gameplay is similar to titles like <i>Metal Slug</i> and <i>Contra</i>. The key difference is that it supports up to 16 players to team up and complete levels together, with clear rewards for successful completion.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Player Skill Duel: Players can freely combine a variety of weapons such as sniper rifles and assault rifles, then fight side by side with teammates against players from opposing factions on the horizontal battlefield.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social System and Village System: Beyond battles, players can move to the leisure village to conduct activities like buying, selling, setting up stalls, and trading the items/ firearms they\u2019ve acquired. They can also form their own teams to grow and progress together.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the virtual world of <i>GigaSlave</i>, you will take on the role of an agent, tackling various plot-driven challenges and engaging in real combat against other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features and Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolling Horizontal Shooter Cooperative Mode: This gameplay is similar to titles like <i>Metal Slug</i> and <i>Contra</i>. The key difference is that it supports up to 16 players to team up and complete levels together, with clear rewards for successful completion.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Player Skill Duel: Players can freely combine a variety of weapons such as sniper rifles and assault rifles, then fight side by side with teammates against players from opposing factions on the horizontal battlefield.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social System and Village System: Beyond battles, players can move to the leisure village to conduct activities like buying, selling, setting up stalls, and trading the items/ firearms they\u2019ve acquired. They can also form their own teams to grow and progress together.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "GigaSlave is a horizontal-scrolling multiplayer online shooting game developed as a tribute to Metal Slug. It inherits the scrolling level-clearing gameplay of Metal Slug and, in a masterful touch, adds a PVP mode. In the game, the trading and social systems stand out as its most striking features.",
